          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cheliluwu akwankunyi nawaYuda nawaBenjamini anatiyi nawu ayilimuwuduŋu adi nakunamutuŋila Yehova Nzambi yaIsarela tembeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hiyakuswila kwakwihi naZerubabeli nawawakulumpi akumavumu awankakulula, hiyakuyila nawu, Twitŋienu tutuŋi nenu, muloŋa twamukeŋakeŋaŋa Nzambi yenu neyi chimwelaŋa enu, twamuketwilaŋa yimuna kufumisha kumafuku adiŋiyi mwanta wakuAshuri Esahadoni watuleteli kunu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa Zerubabeli naYeshuwa nawawakulumpi asheluku akumavumu awankakulula awaIsarela, hiyakuyila nawu, Etu kunamutuŋila Nzambi yetu itala hamunanenu nehi; etu aweni tukudibomba tunamutuŋili Yehova Nzambi yaIsarela, mwatulejeli mwanta wakuPeresi Kirua i.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu amwituŋa chanatiyuwu ochu hiyakuyizeyeshaŋa aYuda, hiyakuyikabishaŋa iku adi nakutuŋa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hiyakuyikwatila amahaku akuyifwishaŋa mafuku ejima adiŋiyi mwanta wakuPeresi Kirusi, ndo nikumafuku adiŋiyi mwanta wakuPeresi Dariyusa muwanta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadiŋiyi Ahazu wenausi muwanta, hohatachikili kuyulayi, hiyakumusonekela mukanda wakuyinka eniYuda naYerusalema muloŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamafuku adiŋiyi Aratasheshe, aBishilami naMiteredati naTabeyeli nawamabwambu jindi anashali, amusonekeleli mwanta wakuPeresi Aratasheshe mukanda; mukanda awusonekeli nansona jawaSiriya, nsaŋu jadiŋumu ajilumbulwili mwidimi dawaSiriya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwakuyula Rehumi, nansoneki Shimishayi, hiyakumusonekela mwanta Aratasheshe mukanda wakuholokela Yerusalema; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nawu, Mukwakuyula Rehumi, nansoneki Shimishayi, nawamabwambu jawu anashali, wowu akuDina, nakuAfwasaki, nakuTarapeli, nakuAfwarasi, nakuArakevi, nakuBabiloni, nakuShushani, nakuDehavi, nakuElami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ninyuza yinashali yaleteli Osinaŋari muneni walema, ashiliyi mumukala waSamariya ni mwituŋa dinashaluku damwishinadi dakaloŋa, nsaŋu oyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukanda watemesheleluwu mwanta Aratasheshe awusonekeli mwenimu, nawu; Etu ambuŋeyi antu amwishinadi dakaloŋa, nsaŋu oyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta eluki, aYudeya afumini kudeyi enza dehi kudetu kuYerusalema. Adi nakutuŋa mukalowu watama wadikaŋa, amanisha dehi mpwembu, aloŋesha dehi nichikuku chakutuŋila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta eluki, neyi mukaliwu akawutuŋa, nimpwembu akajimanisha, hiyamba kahana hela himulambu hela kasitomi, hela mwombuku, chenochu chamba kakehesha kadiilu kawanyanta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu etu twadyaŋa muŋwa wamwitala damwanta, hitunatiyi kuwaha kumona chakusawukayi mwantaku, dichi tunatemeshi mazu akumwilukisha mwanta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kulonda akata latali chachiwahi mumukanda wawankakulula jeyi wakushindulula. Mumukanda wakushindulula wakamona, wakeluka neyi mukaliwu himukala wadikaŋa, wabondaŋa anyanta nawayilolu, mukachi kawu hanyaka akwatilaŋa mpùŋa jatama, mwaka hafumi nikujilumuna mukaliwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hitukumwilukisha mwanta netu, Neyi mukaliwu akawutuŋa, nimpwembu akajimanisha, hiwakamona nawa cheŋi hawudiilu mwishinadi dinu dakaloŋaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta hakutemesha mazu akwakula mukwakuyula Rehumi, nansoneki Shimishayi, nawamabwambu jawu anashali ashakama muSamariya, ni mwituŋa dinashali damwishinadi dakaloŋa, nindi, Kolenu. Nsaŋu oyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukanda wumwatutemeshela anawuntaŋili chalumbuluka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami nashumu dehi lushimbi, anatalatali dehi, anamoni komana mukaliwu kunyaka wadivwimbilaŋa nawanyanta, mukachi kawu elilaŋa nikudikaŋa nikukwata mpùŋa yatama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwadiŋi nawa anyanta aYerusalema aswejeli Ŋovu, ayulili ituŋa damwishinadi dakaloŋa dejima, ayinkelaŋa ninyilambu, nikasitomi ninyombu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shenumu lushimbi lwakulekesha antu awa, kulonda mukalowu akabuli kuwutuŋa, nichinamba kashamu lushimbi lwacheŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babalenu, bayi mwakalabajala nansaŋu iyuku, indi akukehesheladi kadiilu kawanyanta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukanda wamwanta Aratasheshe watutulwiluwu chayitaŋililuwu aRehumi nansoneki Shimishayi nawamabwambu jawu, hiyakunyakala kuya kuYerusalema kudi aYudeya, hiyakuyilekesha chandombu naŋovu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mudimu wetala daNzambi dekala kuYerusalema wimana ni kwimana. Wemeni ho-o kushika nikumwaka wamuchiyedi wawanta wamwanta wakuPeresi Dariyusa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
